  "body": "I was looking at the final patch of #7768 and it struck me that it implies a microtask checkpoint can be performed when there are no tasks on the queue. However, that assumes a microtask can be enqueued without a corresponding task, right? I don't think that's something we mean to support.\r\n\r\nShould what is now step 3 of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#event-loop-processing-model be nested under step 2?\r\n\r\ncc @smaug---- ",
